</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Why restless, why cast down, my soul?</l><l>Trust God, who will employ</l><l>His aid for thee, and change these sighs</l><l>To thankful hymns of joy.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For Thee, my God, the living God,</l><l>My thirsty soul doth pine;</l><l>Oh, when shall I behold Thy face,</l><l>Thou Majesty Divine?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>God of my strength, how long shall I,</l><l>Like one forgotten, mourn,</l><l>Forlorn, forsaken, and exposed</l><l>To my oppressor’s scorn?</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Why restless, why cast down, my soul?</l><l>Hope still, and thou shalt sing</l><l>The praise of Him who is thy God,</l><l>Thy health’s eternal spring.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
